[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3157259073","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104581#issuecomment-3157259073","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104581","id":3157259073,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68L_NB","user":{"login":"CavemanIke","id":37808341,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3ODA4MzQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37808341?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CavemanIke","html_url":"https://github.com/CavemanIke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CavemanIke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CavemanIke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CavemanIke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CavemanIke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CavemanIke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CavemanIke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CavemanIke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CavemanIke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CavemanIke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T03:10:17Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T03:10:17Z","body":"I discovered two things that may be related to this.\n\n1. If there is a typed dictionary whose value uses an inbuilt node type or Resource such as a `PackedScene` or `AudioStream`, and if one were to click the drop-down and click \"Clear\" from the menu next to an entry's value, it will cause the value to become `<null>` and cannot be edited afterward. It can only be restored by deleting/recreating or simply creating a key with the same name with a new value which will then immediately replace the existing one.\n\n2. If one were to click the drop-down and then click \"Clear\" *before* clicking the \"Add Key/Value Pair\" button, it will set that entire field to `<null>` and will stay that way, meaning that a value cannot be added to a new key/value pair and will always be `<null>`. The only way to restore proper functionality is to navigate to something else in the inspector and back again.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3157259073/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368742645","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104581#issuecomment-3368742645","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104581","id":3368742645,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Iyu71","user":{"login":"eisegesis-623","id":116929197,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvgyrQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116929197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eisegesis-623","html_url":"https://github.com/eisegesis-623","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eisegesis-623/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eisegesis-623/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eisegesis-623/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eisegesis-623/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eisegesis-623/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eisegesis-623/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eisegesis-623/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eisegesis-623/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eisegesis-623/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T04:36:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T04:37:24Z","body":"This issue interrupts development constantly for me. Not being able to modify keys in the inspector can make dictionaries frustrating to use in several situations.\n\nFor example, if the key is a resource, it requires searching for the file. If the FileSystem is used for this, then one wrong click will switch the Inspector to that other asset, which is incredibly inconvenient. (Even if a feature like https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9265 addressed some of that frustration, this would still be an unnecessary extra step.)\n\nIf the key is a more complex type (like an array), it's not just a matter of \"adding a new key/value pair.\" There doesn't seem to be a way to copy the key (`right-click -> copy` on an array entry seems to copy the dictionary as a whole, though that may be a bug in its own right), so you have to repeat the process multiple times.\n\nEven when editing a key is trivial (i.e. it's just an integer), it requires you to carefully double-check that you've entered the key correctly. Otherwise, you might add an extra entry or, worse yet, accidentally edit the wrong one!\n\nFurthermore, if the dictionary is large enough, it can take time just to locate the entry, and if it's not on the last page you have to switch back to replace the entry. Plus, it's just more complicated than it needs to be.\n\nI'm sure there are good reasons for this limitation from a technical perspective (making it easier to avoid duplicate keys, etc.), but it's enough of a UX headache that I strongly believe it's worth pursuing.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368742645/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750595524","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104581#issuecomment-3750595524","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104581","id":3750595524,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fjYvE","user":{"login":"vancura1337","id":102156719,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhbJrw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102156719?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vancura1337","html_url":"https://github.com/vancura1337","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vancura1337/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vancura1337/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vancura1337/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vancura1337/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vancura1337/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vancura1337/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vancura1337/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vancura1337/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vancura1337/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T17:02:32Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T17:02:32Z","body":"And also, It seems like the dictionary doesn't even preserve insertion order as it does in GDScript. It gets sorted alphabetically after reloading the editor.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750595524/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4107347560","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104581#issuecomment-4107347560","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104581","id":4107347560,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc700SZo","user":{"login":"elvisish","id":16231628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjMxNjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16231628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish","html_url":"https://github.com/elvisish","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-23T00:42:25Z","updated_at":"2026-03-23T00:42:25Z","body":"Is it meant to be possible to rename the exported dictionary key? It would be very convenient to be able to, but I haven't known it to be ever possible.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4107347560/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4148330168","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104581#issuecomment-4148330168","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104581","id":4148330168,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73Qn64","user":{"login":"Wolfcrux","id":43683855,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNjgzODU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43683855?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wolfcrux","html_url":"https://github.com/Wolfcrux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wolfcrux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wolfcrux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wolfcrux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wolfcrux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wolfcrux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wolfcrux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wolfcrux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wolfcrux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wolfcrux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-28T15:58:58Z","updated_at":"2026-03-28T15:58:58Z","body":"Is this not a regression? I just ran into this today and I swear you used to be able to edit dictionary keys in the inspector but maybe I'm taking crazy pills.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4148330168/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4284412073","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104581#issuecomment-4284412073","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104581","id":4284412073,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_XvCp","user":{"login":"AstroStucky","id":17039973,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDM5OTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17039973?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AstroStucky","html_url":"https://github.com/AstroStucky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AstroStucky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AstroStucky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AstroStucky/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AstroStucky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AstroStucky/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AstroStucky/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AstroStucky/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AstroStucky/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AstroStucky/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-20T21:30:01Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T21:30:01Z","body":"I can confirm I'm seeing the same issue with keys being unmodifiable in 4.6.2, only I exported my typed Dictionary using\n```GDScript\n@export_custom(PROPERTY_HINT_TYPE_STRING, \"String;PackedScene\")\n```\n\n@Vancura1337 Exported Dictionary get sorted. It would also happen if the Dictionary was populated by a script. It's being discussed separately in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/90142\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4284412073/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4873864884","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104581#issuecomment-4873864884","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104581","id":4873864884,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIoFGtA","user":{"login":"Kylemcarthur","id":29736706,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzM2NzA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29736706?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur","html_url":"https://github.com/Kylemcarthur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kylemcarthur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-03T07:33:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T07:55:16Z","body":"This issue somehow got critically worse with a regression in v4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]\n\nHere is a screenshot from v4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4]\n\n<img width=\"856\" height=\"256\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/105a73d7-b82c-4383-8632-527d28cbe421\" />\n\nNow in 4.7.\n\n<img width=\"871\" height=\"137\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b7b584b9-75e0-48ca-a7af-b0acb89ad5b4\" />\n\nUnlike before, these `Trigger` data containers I use as keys can no longer be interacted with in the inspector in any way as far as I can tell. Clicking on them does nothing. I can't edit their properties, I can't view them, I can't save them into a separate asset to edit, nothing. This bricks the functionality I use throughout my project.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4873864884/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":3,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4881336614","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104581#issuecomment-4881336614","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104581","id":4881336614,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIvNJJg","user":{"login":"HobTheGoblin","id":174258972,"node_id":"U_kgDOCmL7HA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174258972?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HobTheGoblin","html_url":"https://github.com/HobTheGoblin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HobTheGoblin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HobTheGoblin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HobTheGoblin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HobTheGoblin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HobTheGoblin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HobTheGoblin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HobTheGoblin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HobTheGoblin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HobTheGoblin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-04T08:42:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T08:42:57Z","body":"@Kylemcarthur You are right, i also can reproduce this.\nI gues it would be best if you open a new issue (if there isnt already another one) because:\nChanging keys itself did never work in the inspector and thus its not a Bug. But not being able to change the attributes of a key object is a regression and thus a bug.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4881336614/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]